target_answer:
You want a puzzle solver app that meets all the requirements of the National Puzzle League, and you want me to produce it as a full HTML, CSS, JS in one file. Here is the best solution that I can come up with:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>NPL Puzzle Solver</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #6a1b9a;
      --primary-dark: #4a148c;
      --primary-light: #9c27b0;
      --accent: #ffc107;
      --bg: #f5f0ff;
      --card: #ffffff;
      --text: #1a1a2e;
      --muted: #666;
      --border: #e0d6f5;
      --success: #4caf50;
      --error: #f44336;
      --cell: #ffffff;
      --cell-block: #1a1a2e;
      --cell-active: #fff3cd;
      --cell-related: #f3e5f5;
      --radius: 12px;
      --shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(106, 27, 154, 0.12);
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f0ff 0%, #e8f4fd 50%, #fff3e0 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
      color: var(--text);
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .container { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; }

    /* ===== HEADER ===== */
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 24px 0 8px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .header h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-light));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .header p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .header .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 2px 12px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    /* ===== PUZZLE TYPE SELECTOR ===== */
    .puzzle-selector {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .puzzle-btn {
      padding: 10px 22px;
      border: 2px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--card);
      border-radius: 30px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      outline: none;
    }
    .puzzle-btn:hover {
      border-color: var(--primary);
      background: var(--bg);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .puzzle-btn.active {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      border-color: var(--primary);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(106, 27, 154, 0.35);
    }

    /* ===== TIMER & CONTROLS BAR ===== */
    .controls-bar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      background: var(--card);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 14px 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .timer {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--primary);
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      min-width: 100px;
    }
    .btn-group

